# CMDEDIT-SEL-08: Selection of edit metal1 and child poly; delete.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
load c
box 0 0 10 10
paint poly
save c
load top
box 20 0 20 0
getcell c
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
box -5 -5 40 15
select area
delete
writeall force
